  "solution": "**Concept used:**\n\nCosec 45° = √2 ; sec 45° = √2\n\nCosec 30° = 2 ; sec 30° = (2/√3) \n\n**Calculation:**\n\nCosec 75° = cosec (45 + 30)\n\ncosec (45 + 30) = (sec 45 × sec 30 × cosec 45 × cosec 30)/{(sec 45 × cosec 30) + (cosec 45 × sec 30)}\n\n⇒ (√2 × (2/√3) × √2 × 2)/{(√2 × 2) + (√2 × (2/√3))}\n\n⇒ (8/√3)/{2√2 + (2√2/√3)}\n\n⇒ (8/√3)/{(2√6 + 2√2)/√3}\n\n⇒ 8/(2√6 + 2√2)\n\nBy rationalizing the term\n\n⇒ 8 × (2√6 - 2√2)/{(2√6 + 2√2) × (2√6 - 2√2)}\n\n⇒ (16√6 - 16√2)/{(2√6)² - (2√2)²}\n\n⇒ 16 × (√6 - √2)/{24 - 8}\n\n⇒ 16 × (√6 - √2)/16 = (√6 - √2)\n\n**∴ The correct answer is (√6 - √2). **",
